Scoped enums with a fixed underlying type (uint8_t) as bit-fields among
uint8_t / bool bit-fields, with straddling: System V ABI storage-unit rule
(a bit-field that does not fit in the rest of its type-sized unit starts
at the next unit) -- 'A' is 3 bytes, not 2; packed structs pack densely.
